WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.373 --> 00:00:11.607
&gt;&gt; Greg: IN THE LATEST

00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:12.508
INSTALLMENT OF WHAT HAPPENED IN

00:00:11.741 --> 00:00:14.443
AN ELECTION THAT OCCURRED A YEAR

00:00:12.641 --> 00:00:16.212
AND A HALF AGO, MICHELLE OBAMA

00:00:14.577 --> 00:00:17.813
WAS ASKED HOW TRUMP WON, AND SHE

00:00:16.345 --> 00:00:19.048
LAY THE BLAME ON HILLARY.

00:00:17.947 --> 00:00:21.450
JUST KIDDING.

00:00:19.181 --> 00:00:22.451
SHE BLAMED SEXISM FROM WOMEN

00:00:21.584 --> 00:00:26.422
AGAINST WOMEN.

00:00:22.585 --> 00:00:27.423
&gt;&gt; IN LIGHT OF THIS LAST

00:00:26.555 --> 00:00:28.824
ELECTION, I AM CONCERNED ABOUT

00:00:27.556 --> 00:00:30.626
US AS WOMEN AND HOW WE THINK.

00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:32.995
IF WE ARE NOT COMFORTABLE WITH

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:35.631
THE NOTION THAT A WOMAN COULD BE

00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:38.234
OUR PRESIDENT COMPARED TO WHAT?

00:00:35.765 --> 00:00:39.435
YOU KNOW, WE HAVE TO HAVE THAT

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.436
CONVERSATION WITH OURSELVES AS

00:00:39.568 --> 00:00:42.238
WOMEN.

00:00:40.569 --> 00:00:44.073
&gt;&gt; Greg: MAYBE SO, BUT HER

00:00:42.371 --> 00:00:45.408
ANALYSIS SEEMS A SYMPTOM OF A

00:00:44.206 --> 00:00:47.043
GREATER PROBLEM THAT CONTRIBUTED

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:48.778
TO HER PARTY'S LOSS.

00:00:47.176 --> 00:00:49.245
GOES BACK TO SEEING THE GROUP

